OL,3,GNEWSAPolice officer sacked for slapping
OL,4,Apartner twice
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Kent Police officer has been sacked
OL,7,Ffor slapping her partner twice during a
OL,8,Frelationship "breakdown", a misconduct
OL,9,Fhearing has been told.
OL,11,FDet Con Nicole Money said it was a
OL,12,F"momentary wrong decision" which she
OL,13,Fdeeply regretted and that she had
OL,14,Fworked towards becoming a police
OL,15,Fofficer for most of her life.
OL,17,FThe force deemed her actions amounted
OL,18,Fto gross misconduct and she was
OL,19,Fdismissed without notice.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
