OL,3,GNEWSAPolice officer sacked for slapping
OL,4,Apartner twice
OL,5,
OL,6,FDet Supt Joanna Lay, of Kent Police's
OL,7,Fprofessional standards department,
OL,8,Fsaid: "We expect our officers to
OL,9,Fconduct themselves in an exemplary
OL,10,Fmanner both on and off duty and treat
OL,11,Fothers with respect and courtesy."
